{"path":"container/inplace_vector/pop_back","title":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::pop_back","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::inplace_vector&lt;T,N&gt;::</span>pop_back","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/pop_back","section":"container","kind":"page","summary":"Removes the last element of the container.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> pop_back<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Removes the last element of the container.\n</p><p>Calling <code>pop_back</code> on an empty container results in undefined behavior.\n</p><p>Iterators and references to the last element are invalidated. The <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/end\"><code>end()</code></a> iterator is also invalidated.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Exceptions\">Exceptions</h3>\n<p>Throws nothing.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;inplace_vector&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;print&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector\"><span class=\"kw3363\">std::<span class=\"me2\">inplace_vector</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> numbers<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">for</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> not numbers.<span class=\"me1\">empty</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> numbers.<span class=\"me1\">pop_back</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"{}\"</span>, numbers<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>[1, 2, 3]\n[1, 2]\n[1]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/container/inplace_vector/push_back\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>push_back</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds an element to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Exceptions","id":"Exceptions"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"container","title":"Containers library"},{"path":"container/inplace_vector","title":"std::inplace_vector"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::inplace_vector<T,N>::pop_back","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Removes the last element of the container."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Exceptions","note":"Throws nothing."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"push_back","note":"adds an element to the end"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":85,"codeBlockCount":2}
